                "Value": {
                  "StringWithMarkup": [
                    {
                      "String": "2-dehydro-3-deoxy-D-galactonic acid is the 2-dehydro-3-deoxy derivative of D-galactonic acid. It has a role as an Escherichia coli metabolite. It is a ketoaldonic acid and a hexonic acid. It is functionally related to a galactonic acid. It is a conjugate acid of a 2-dehydro-3-deoxy-D-galactonate. It is an enantiomer of a 2-keto-3-deoxy-L-galactonic acid.",
